    "steps": [
      "Heat the oven to 400°F (200°C).",
      "Whisk the egg white in a small bowl until it holds soft peaks.",
      "Whisk the whole egg with the sweet rice flour in a medium bowl until combined.",
      "Whisk in the sea salt, honey and vanilla.",
      "Add the warm almond milk gradually, whisking all the time, until no lumps remain.",
      "Fold the whipped white into the batter gently with a spatula, keeping the air in, until no streaks remain.",
      "Set a small ovenproof skillet, 6 inches (15 cm) across, on low and let it warm for 1–2 minutes.",
      "Melt the clarified butter or coconut oil in the skillet and swirl to coat the whole base and sides.",
      "Pour in the batter, turn the heat to medium-low and cook 2–3 minutes, until the rim of the pancake firms up.",
      "Scatter the fruit over the top.",
      "Bake in the oven for 7–8 minutes, until puffed, golden and set in the middle.",
      "Take the skillet out with an oven mitt. Drizzle with the maple syrup, add the topping fruit, dust with powdered sugar and serve right away.",
      "You nailed it! Grab a plate and dig in."
